               "summary":  "Cloudflare reported its strongest quarter in years on 2026-11-05: 39% growth, 122% net retention, raised guidance and a fast-growing AI-agent developer base. The moat thesis looks intact. The stock, however, has given back its post-earnings rally, closing at $274.96 after a 9.46% fall on 2026-11-20 during an AI-led market selloff. Technically the picture is neutral: the short-term trend is broken, but the long-term trend holds above the $267.65 EMA 200. Watch that level and gross margins."
